; Sharp PC-1600  --  system ROM, Page 1 / Bank 3 (4000H-7FFFH), NEW revision
; ROM file: PC-1600-ROM/dumps/new/PC1600-P1-B3.BIN  (MD5 6f6e1a9d46db7dc91d4322c93583ac81)
; Generated by tools/romdis/build.py from disasm/new/PC1600-P1-B3/PC1600-P1-B3.ann -- edit the
; .ann file, not this one.  Reassembles byte-identical with z80asm.
